#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-services.php
msgid ""
"Fabrication and site services of companies and professionals: service pages "
"with photos, capabilities, equipment and coverage, service requests answered"
" with a quote, portfolio of completed projects. Engineering studies are "
"handled by SM Engineering. Requires SM Core."
msgstr ""
"خدمات التصنيع والورشات للشركات والمهنيين: صفحات خدمات بالصور والقدرات "
"والتجهيزات والمناطق، طلبات خدمات بعروض أسعار، والمشاريع المنجزة. الدراسات "
"الهندسية تمر عبر SM Engineering. يتطلب SM Core."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-services.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr "ReuSteel"

